<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11438] TTL manager may not clear entries from the underlying CacheDataStore</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11438</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Please see the attached test:&lt;/p&gt;
